  "implementation_notes": [
    "Order is deliberately shuffled, not the shape's spatial order (bottom-right \u2192 top-right \u2192 bottom-left \u2192 top-center \u2192 bottom-center \u2192 top-left) \u2014 this is what was approved, do not 'correct' it to clockwise order.",
    "transformBox: fill-box scales each petal from its own center, not the icon's overall center \u2014 well-supported in current browsers but worth a quick cross-browser check since it runs continuously in-app.",
    "Framer Motion mapping: each path as its own <motion.path> with animate={{ opacity: [1, 0.35, 1], scale: [1, 0.88, 1] }}, transition={{ duration: 1.5, delay: delayMs/1000, ease: 'easeInOut', repeat: Infinity }}.",
    "CSS mapping: shared @keyframes dimPulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } 50% { opacity: 0.35; transform: scale(0.88); } }, with animation-delay set per path per the delayMs values above.",
    "Respect prefers-reduced-motion: fall back to static #C15F3C fill, opacity 1, no animation.",
    "Superseded prior directions, kept here for reference only: (1) two-color fill swap #C15F3C\u2192#D97858 sequential and shuffled variants, (2) whole-icon rotation + traveling color wave, (3) whole-icon single synchronized pulse, (4) per-petal scale-up-while-glowing. This dim/shrink, single-color, shuffled-order version is the one to build."
  ]
